        "html": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }\n        .header { background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 25px; text-align: center; }\n        .content { padding: 30px; }\n        .details-box { background-color: #f9f9f9; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }\n        .cal-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 15px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; }\n        .footer { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <p>Hi {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json['First Name'] }},</p>\n            <p>We are just two days away from diving into the <strong>AI for Funding Master Class</strong>. Our team is finalizing the materials to help you move from asking AI questions to commanding AI workflows.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"details-box\">\n                <p><strong>Topic:</strong> AI Foundations & Ethical Use</p>\n                <p><strong>When:</strong> This Wednesday @ 8:00 AM EST</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <p>Please ensure you have Zoom installed and your \"Opportunity Snapshot\" notes ready if you opted for one.</p>\n            \n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n                <a href=\"https://us06web.zoom.us/j/2932797280\" class=\"cal-btn\">Access the Zoom Room Here</a>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer\">&copy; 2026 Go Fund It Now, LLC</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
